=== ARCHITECTURE ===
# Thin view (DigitalTwinPage.cs : UserControl) renders the projected DigitalTwinPageDisplay.
# DigitalTwinPageViewModel (INotifyPropertyChanged) owns the shared VehicleSelectState (native
#   useSelectedVehicle()), loads the fleet (web useVehicles), defaults to the first vehicle, reads
#   the selected vehicle's state+security+charging trio and re-polls every 5 s (REFRESH_INTERVAL).
# DigitalTwinPageProjection (pure) merges the reads via the shared DigitalTwinSignals (the port of
#   web buildTwinState) and resolves every literal through ILocalizer.
# DigitalTwinPageClientFeed binds the generated client (ADR-004): GET /vehicles, /vehicles/{id}/state,
#   /security/latest?vehicle_id=, /charging-telemetry/latest?vehicle_id= (snake_case params).
# Units: physical state only (booleans/enums) — no SI quantities on this page; nothing stored non-SI.

